[61.266296, "o", "  CRIT  NODE-03  \u001b[01;31m\u001b[K 26.3 \u001b[m\u001b[K the NVIDIA container toolkit is in an advisory's affected range\r\n                       nodes.json: gpu-node-1: toolkit 1.17.4: CVE-2025-23266 (fixed in 1.17.8; affected: up to and including 1.17.7 (before 1.17.5 only in CDI mode))\r\n  HIGH  K8S-01   \u001b[01;31m\u001b[K 26.3 \u001b[m\u001b[K a pod runs privileged or on the host network\r\n                       k8s: vllm: hostNetwork: true\r\n  HIGH  K8S-01   \u001b[01;31m\u001b[K 26.3 \u001b[m\u001b[K a pod runs privileged or on the host network\r\n                       k8s: vllm/vllm: privileged: true\r\n  HIGH  NODE-02  \u001b[01;31m\u001b[K 26.3 \u001b[m\u001b[K pods can reach the node's IAM role through IMDS\r\n                       cluster.yaml: nodegroup gpu: disableIMDSv1, disablePodIMDS not set to true\r\n  HIGH  NODE-02  \u001b[01;31m\u001b[K 26.3 \u001b[m\u001b[K pods can reach the node's IAM role through IMDS\r\n                       nodes.json: gpu-node-1: IMDS tokens optional, hop limit 2\r\n  HIGH  NODE-04  \u001b[01;31m\u001b[K 26.3 \u001b[m\u001b[K tenants time-share one GPU (no memory isolation)\r\n                       nodes.json: gpu-node-1: time-slicing shared by acme, globex\r\n  HIGH  SEC-01   \u001b[01;31m\u001b[K 26.3 \u001b[m\u001b[K a secret is written into the file\r\n                       docker-compose.yml: vllm: environment HF_TOKEN holds a literal value\r\n  HIGH  SEC-01   \u001b[01;31m\u001b[K 26.3 \u001b[m\u001b[K a secret is written into the file\r\n                       k8s: vllm/vllm: env HF_TOKEN holds a literal value (use a secretKeyRef or Pod Identity)\r\n  MED   K8S-02   \u001b[01;31m\u001b[K 26.3 \u001b[m\u001b[K no default-deny NetworkPolicy for the namespace\r\n                       k8s: namespace inference: no NetworkPolicy that denies all egress by default\r\n  MED   NODE-01  \u001b[01;31m\u001b[K 26.3 \u001b[m\u001b[K the GPU node group has no nvidia.com/gpu taint\r\n                       cluster.yaml: nodegroup gpu: g4dn.xlarge without the nvidia.com/gpu taint\r\n"]
